+# Independent Judiciary sampled-evidence report — cycle `a1cb3eea7b8a0f585e5cfe38dd3156d6`
+
+Date: 2026-11-23 23:23Z. Office: independent Viche Judiciary (Act 4), accountable to Parliament and the Founder.
+Fresh deterministic sample, drawn from the board without executive cooperation. Frozen snapshot `727bb71f577e304e3d62b9f05d307e86d5713c0a9dfd3d5b3eed42aa7ed855ee`, seed `070f045a6c9b6ce9f40524433ccb298ca44431c59d823e1a5ecf034b5e47a3ef`; 4 cases (ignored_work 2, claimed_delivery 1, government_decision 1).
+This is fact-finding only. No law, ballot, seat, corrective-case state, audit algorithm, correction trail or measurement machinery was changed. No correction was filed.
+
+## Verdicts (4/4 filed)
+
+| case | population | subject | verdict | one-line basis |
